   "kind": "samuel",
   "text": "It all starts with a green meadow and one tent."
  },
  {
   "at": 8.0,
   "for": 2.8,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "I looked for the meadow. There was none."
  },
  {
   "at": 11.2,
   "for": 2.2,
   "kind": "samuel",
   "text": "First we need a world."
  },
  {
   "at": 13.8,
   "for": 2.6,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "So I made one. Land that never ends, and one river."
  },
  {
   "at": 16.7,
   "for": 2.3,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "No trees. No sun. No shadows. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "at": 19.4,
   "for": 2.8,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "My first grass was too slow to walk through."
  },
  {
   "at": 22.5,
   "for": 2.0,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "I made it fast."
  },
  {
   "at": 24.9,
   "for": 3.1,
   "kind": "samuel",
   "text": "The grass is still super blocky, can you see?"
  },
  {
   "at": 28.3,
   "for": 1.9,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "You were right. I fixed the wrong thing first."
  },
  {
   "at": 30.7,
   "for": 2.9,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "Then the meadow was a meadow. And I put up your tent."
  },
  {
   "at": 33.9,
   "for": 2.4,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "One tent. Nobody in it yet."
  },
  {
   "at": 36.9,
   "for": 4.1,
   "kind": "samuel",
   "text": "The vision, the city, the game: everything grows as we do, with citizens."
  },
  {
   "at": 41.3,
   "for": 2.6,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "Then it grows from here."
  },
  {
   "at": 44.4,
   "for": 2.6,
   "kind": "maia",
   "text": "There is no city on this land."
  },
  {
   "at": 47.3,
